                        <p class="mb-2">We do not sell or share any personally identifiable information volunteered on the Atal Bhujal Yojana Project-Website to any third party (public/private). Any information provided to this website will be protected from loss, misuse, unauthorized access or disclosure, alteration, or destruction. </p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
